  "content": "\n\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_b0add901-8e9e-4418-845f-1e65c3f72df1.png\" width=\"762\" height=\"254\"></strong></span></a></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用優惠碼 Reggarf-1047 可享全店訂單 20% 折扣！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\">https://zap-hosting.com/reggarf</a></strong></p>\n<p><strong><img style=\"display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_d346f672-075e-4fc3-b6b0-de2af7552b81.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"400\" height=\"400\"></strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/create-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/PzouXFuY?color=34D058&amp;label=Modrinth%20Downloads&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-better-motors\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/1162812?color=FC7303&amp;label=CurseForge%20Downloads&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/issues/Reggarfgod/Create_Better_Motors?color=6E40C9&amp;label=Issues&amp;logo=github\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/JBZxyKNNmY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1188575775776051232?color=5865F2&amp;label=Online%20Users&amp;logo=discord\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #f1c40f;\"><strong>Create: Better Motors</strong></span></h1>\n<p>為你的《我的世界》世界注入強大動力！本模組引入了 7 款強力馬達，能無縫將 <strong>Forge 能量（<span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">FE</span>）</strong> 轉換為 <strong>應力單位（<span style=\"color: #3598db;\">SU</span>）</strong>，為你的機械構建帶來全新可能。</p>\n<p>主要特色：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #b96ad9;\"><strong>高效馬達</strong></span>：將 <span style=\"color: #e03e2d;\">FE</span> 轉換為 <span style=\"color: #3598db;\">SU</span>，內附 7 款專為最佳化效能設計的專屬馬達。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #e67e23;\"><strong>高輸出發電機</strong></span>：透過輸入 SU 最高可產生 <strong>452 FE/t</strong>，完美適用於高耗電的機械配置。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #2dc26b;\"><strong>完全可設定</strong></span>：提供自訂設定選項，讓你量身調整馬達與發電機的參數，確保能完美相容於任何建築風格或遊玩方式。</li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #3598db;\"><strong>雷加福尼特礦石（Reggarfonite Ore）</strong></span>：生成於 Y 軸 <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">-64</span> 至 <span style=\"color: #e67e23;\">64</span> 之間</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_688e3c35-b99c-416a-9459-306b6c43f611.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"1277\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1162812/description_4ea1f30f-9788-44ea-b927-e71851f8eacd.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"762\" height=\"1354\"></p>",
